-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/8: העלאת תעריף הקצובה הביגוד הנוספת למורה לחינוך גופני
-- The rise in the extra clothing allowance for physical-education teachers of
-- the owners of secondary education, from school year 2010/11 (the allowance
-- paid with the July 2011 salary): the rise, the new amounts by employment
-- rate, what they replace, and payment of the difference in December 2011.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/8 העלאת תעריף הקצובה הביגוד הנוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title and the circular's purpose (to publish the rise in the clothing allowance for physical-education teachers of the owners); no rule of its own.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 =
-- 1, December 2011 = 4).

@desc A physical-education teacher of an owner, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `PE teacher` HAS
    `employed by an owner of secondary education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled to the extra PE clothing allowance under the existing rules` IS A BOOLEAN
    `PE employment rate`                 IS A NUMBER @desc the employment rate (שיעור העסקה) the table is read by
    `amount already paid for 2010/11`    IS A NUMBER @desc the extra PE allowance paid with the July 2011 salary, shekels

DECLARE `PE clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the difference` HAS `difference paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

-- Section 1: every physical-education teacher employed by the owners of
-- secondary education who is entitled to the extra allowance under the
-- existing rules.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN t IS A `PE teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` t IF
        t's `employed by an owner of secondary education`
    AND t's `entitled to the extra PE clothing allowance under the existing rules`

§§ `2 העלאת תעריף הקצובה לביגוד למורים לחינוך גופני`

-- Section 2(א): from 2010/11 — from the allowance paid with the July 2011
-- salary — the rate "is raised by 800 ₪".
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
`the rise section 2(א) states` MEANS 800

-- Section 2(ב)'s table as printed ("סכום נכון ל-1/9/10"): "עד 0.3", "מ-0.3
-- עד 0.5", "מ-0.5 ומעלה". Its bounds meet at 0.3 and 0.5 (F-2011-12_tashab_08-b).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
DECLARE `PE band` HAS
    `from PE rate` IS A NUMBER
    `to PE rate`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `PE band amount` IS A NUMBER

`the PE table after the rise` MEANS
    LIST `PE band` 0   0.3 0,
         `PE band` 0.3 0.5 652,
         `PE band` 0.5 999 1301

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the PE table gives for` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `PE band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD r AT LEAST b's `from PE rate` AND r AT MOST b's `to PE rate`)
                `the PE table after the rise`)

`the PE table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each` MEANS
        `the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 652
    AND `the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 652, 1301
#ASSERT `the PE table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_08-a: a rise of 800 ₪ cannot have produced the first two
-- rows: no amount before the rise, being at least 0, ends at 0 or at 652
-- after adding 800. The reading adopted: the table governs (section 2(ג):
-- "the amounts stated above replace" the earlier ones).
`no band but the top one can have risen by 800` MEANS
        (0 MINUS `the rise section 2(א) states`) LESS THAN 0
    AND (652 MINUS `the rise section 2(א) states`) LESS THAN 0
    AND (1301 MINUS `the rise section 2(א) states`) AT LEAST 0
#ASSERT `no band but the top one can have risen by 800`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_08-c: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the teacher's whole position; for a
-- full-position teacher with a fifth in physical education the two differ.
-- The reading adopted: the share in physical education (the input).
`the two readings of the employment rate differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.2 EQUALS `the amounts the PE table gives for` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ`

-- The reading adopted for the bounds (F-2011-12_tashab_08-b): the band that
-- OPENS at a bound ("מ-") governs it.
@export default The extra clothing allowance for a physical-education teacher of an owner for school year 2010/11 and on, after the rise in circular תשע"ב/8
GIVEN t IS A `PE teacher` @desc the teacher
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the PE clothing allowance` t IS
    IF `this circular applies to` t
    THEN BRANCH IF t's `PE employment rate` AT LEAST 0.5 THEN 1301
                IF t's `PE employment rate` AT LEAST 0.3 THEN 652
                OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE 0

-- Section 2(ג): the amounts replace those of section ב of circular תשע"א/3
-- and are not added to them.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
`the circular whose amounts these replace` MEANS "תשע\"א/3, section ב"
`the new amounts are added to the old` MEANS FALSE

-- Section 2(ד): the rise is meant also for buying products that protect the
-- skin from the sun.
@ref akn:art_2__para_d
`what the raised allowance is for` MEANS LIST `clothing`, `products that protect the skin from the sun`

@desc What the extra allowance is for, as section 2(ד) adds.
DECLARE `PE clothing purpose` IS ONE OF
    `clothing`
    `products that protect the skin from the sun`

-- Section 2(ה): the rules for updating the allowance each school year are
-- unchanged.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
`this circular changes the yearly update rules` MEANS FALSE

§§ `3 ביצוע תשלומים`

-- The payments this circular gives rise to — the difference over what was
-- paid with the July 2011 salary — are made with the December 2011 salary.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN t IS A `PE teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `PE clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the difference with December's salary` t IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the difference` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the difference owed` t
    WITHIN `month number` December
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 3: the payments are made with the December 2011 salary"

-- The difference: the new amount less what was paid in July 2011.
GIVEN t IS A `PE teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference owed` t IS
    max 0 (`the PE clothing allowance` t MINUS t's `amount already paid for 2010/11`)

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The amount already paid (500) is a placeholder.
`a teacher at 0.6 of a position in PE` MEANS
    `PE teacher` WITH
        `employed by an owner of secondary education` IS TRUE
        `entitled to the extra PE clothing allowance under the existing rules` IS TRUE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0.6
        `amount already paid for 2010/11`    IS 500

#ASSERT `the PE clothing allowance` `a teacher at 0.6 of a position in PE` EQUALS 1301
#TRACE `paying the difference with December's salary` `a teacher at 0.6 of a position in PE` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the difference` 801 AT 4
#TRACE `paying the difference with December's salary` `a teacher at 0.6 of a position in PE` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the difference` 801 AT 5

-- F-2011-12_tashab_08-d: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%` MEANS
    sum (`the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.4) PLUS sum (`the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.4)
        GREATER THAN sum (`the amounts the PE table gives for` 0.8)
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over its whole finite space: employment rates in tenths
-- from 0 to 1.5, employed by an owner or not, entitled under the existing
-- rules or not, and amounts already paid from nothing to above the top
-- band.

`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`amounts already paid checked` MEANS LIST 0, 252, 501, 652, 1000, 1301, 2000

GIVEN o IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A NUMBER, paid IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `PE teacher`
DECIDE `a checked teacher` o e r paid IS
    `PE teacher` WITH
        `employed by an owner of secondary education` IS o
        `entitled to the extra PE clothing allowance under the existing rules` IS e
        `PE employment rate`                 IS r
        `amount already paid for 2010/11`    IS paid

-- 2(ב) over employment rates in tenths: every rate is in some band, two
-- exactly at 0.3 and 0.5 (F-2011-12_tashab_08-b, whole space), the amount
-- is one of those bands', and it never falls with the rate. Section 1:
-- nothing for a teacher outside the circular.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the PE table gives for` r
                    a MEANS `the PE clothing allowance` (`a checked teacher` TRUE TRUE r 0)
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (r EQUALS 0.3 OR r EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `the PE clothing allowance` (`a checked teacher` TRUE TRUE (r PLUS 0.1) 0))
            `tenths to 1.5`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN o YIELD
                all (GIVEN e YIELD
                        all (GIVEN r YIELD
                                (`this circular applies to` (`a checked teacher` o e r 0) EQUALS (o AND e))
                                AND ((o AND e) OR `the PE clothing allowance` (`a checked teacher` o e r 0) EQUALS 0))
                            `tenths to 1.5`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- Section 3 over every rate and amount already paid: the difference owed
-- is never negative, never more than the new amount, and nothing once the
-- new amount has been paid.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                all (GIVEN paid YIELD
                        LET t MEANS `a checked teacher` TRUE TRUE r paid
                        IN      `the difference owed` t AT LEAST 0
                            AND `the difference owed` t AT MOST `the PE clothing allowance` t
                            AND ((paid LESS THAN `the PE clothing allowance` t) OR `the difference owed` t EQUALS 0))
                    `amounts already paid checked`)
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_08-c: over the rates in tenths, the two readings of
-- "שיעור העסקה" part for a full-position teacher exactly where the PE share
-- is below 0.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                (NOT (`the PE clothing allowance` (`a checked teacher` TRUE TRUE r 0)
                      EQUALS `the PE clothing allowance` (`a checked teacher` TRUE TRUE 1 0)))
                EQUALS (r LESS THAN 0.5))
            `tenths to 1.5`
